  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 402.27 Lining",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 402.27 “Lining” means a coating of non-corrosive material bonded to the interior surface of a tank.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Or 400) #10393, eff 9-1-13; ss by #12643, eff 10-10-18 (formerly Env-Or 402.20) (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Or 400)",
